@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-002-record-createdat-and-updatedat-on-each-task
+type: task
+title: "Record createdAt and updatedAt on each task"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Every task records when it was created and last changed.
+
+- `Task` has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings.
+- On `add` the two are equal.
+- Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging and untagging a task set its `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes.
+- The domain reads no clock (rule r3): `createTaskList` takes a clock function; `createTodoList` supplies the real one.
+
